##
## Arch Linux [extra] mirrorlist. Artix ships Arch's `extra` repo alongside
## system/world/galaxy (see artix-archlinux-support); this is where chromium
## and mkinitcpio-archiso come from. `core` is deliberately NOT enabled: its
## systemd packages conflict with Artix's init system.
##
## $repo and $arch are substituted by pacman.
##

Server = https://geo.mirror.pkgbuild.com/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirror.rackspace.com/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
Server = https://mirrors.kernel.org/archlinux/$repo/os/$arch
